<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠλ-ιστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for rolling, large</i>, 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυτός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				707.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>twined in a circle</i>, epith. of a kind of garland, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				272.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλιστός</span></b> , ὁ, <i>roll of papyrus, large letter</i>, or
			<i>packet</i> of letters, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PHib.</u>
				1.110.51
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <i>parcel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱματίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
